 the MIT Museum wants to be an  experimenter it wants to find new ways  of taking science to new audiences and I  think this is going to take a step  further forward to really say let's  wrestle with these these hard contracts  do not shy away from them  what can we do this to try to help  people get there get their hands around  this kind of complicated thing I think  you wrap all those together you have a  really a really amazing experience for  an audience please wow this is wondrous  and if we can inspire sense of wonder I  think that's really exciting  [Music]

